 "dialogue": [
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "Nigel is our new next-door neighbour.",
   "zh": "奈杰尔是我们新搬来的隔壁邻居。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L093.mp4",
    "start": 7,
    "end": 10.4
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "He's a pilot.",
   "zh": "他是个飞行员。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L093.mp4",
    "start": 10.4,
    "end": 12
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "He was in the R.A.F.",
   "zh": "他曾在皇家空军任职。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L093.mp4",
    "start": 12,
    "end": 15
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "He will fly to New York next month.",
   "zh": "下个月他将飞往纽约。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L093.mp4",
    "start": 15,
    "end": 18.3
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "The month after next he'll fly to Tokyo.",
   "zh": "再下个月他将飞往东京。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L093.mp4",
    "start": 18.3,
    "end": 22.1
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "At the moment, he's in Madrid.",
   "zh": "现在他在马德里。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L093.mp4",
    "start": 22.1,
    "end": 25
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "He flew to Spain a week ago.",
   "zh": "他是一星期以前飞到西班牙的。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L093.mp4",
    "start": 25,
    "end": 28.1
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "He'll return to London the week after next.",
   "zh": "再下个星期他将返回伦敦。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L093.mp4",
    "start": 28.1,
    "end": 31.8
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "He's only forty-one years old, and he has already been to nearly every country in the world.",
   "zh": "他只有 41 岁，但他却去过世界上几乎每一个国家。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L093.mp4",
    "start": 31.8,
    "end": 39.5
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "Nigel is a very lucky man.",
   "zh": "奈杰尔是个很幸运的人。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L093.mp4",
    "start": 39.5,
    "end": 42.8
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "But his wife isn't very lucky.",
   "zh": "但他的妻子运气不很好。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L093.mp4",
    "start": 42.8,
    "end": 45.6
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "",
   "en": "She usually stays at home!",
   "zh": "她总是呆在家里！",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L093.mp4",
    "start": 45.6,
    "end": 49
   }
  }
 ],
